/* ============================================================
   PIPPO & ME — Real-World Learning pack
   7 categories × 10 skills × 5 lessons = 350 lessons.
   Lesson 1 basics → 2 concepts → 3 real-life → 4 practice
   → 5 final challenge, exactly as the player asked.
   Tiny DSL below compiles into P.data.COURSES (course =
   category, unit = mini-skill) so the lesson engine, sparks,
   shelf and journal all work unchanged. Every lesson is free —
   sparks are pure learning stars.
   ============================================================ */
